      en: ["Established in 1923 through the merger of Colli and Felice", "Elevation is 158 meters above sea level", "Main church is San Gaetano located in the town center", "Part of the Frosinone province in the Lazio region", "Economy is driven by agriculture and small-scale industry", "Population consists of approximately 1,800 inhabitants"],
